1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 13=

4
00:01:59,340 --> 00:01:59,820
Your Highness.

5
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:03,660
Did Yan Shang upset you?

6
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:06,780
No.

7
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:13,820
He didn't upset me.

8
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:17,780
Hearing him say those silly things

9
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:22,580
actually made me quite happy.

10
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:26,380
Then why do you look

11
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:27,220
so unhappy?

12
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:29,140
What exactly did Yan Shang say?

13
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:34,380
Seeing him come back
in such a terrible state,

14
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:37,300
I was furious and had nowhere
to vent my anger.

15
00:02:40,620 --> 00:02:41,580
Enough worrying about me.

16
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,180
How are things between you
and Liu Wenji?

17
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:51,060
Don't keep dragging things out.

18
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:52,420
Whether you stay together or part ways,

19
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:54,700
you need to make things clear with him.

20
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,380
(Grocery Store)
Princess Danyang

21
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:07,020
has been most gracious

22
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:09,100
and treated me very well.

23
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:10,660
It's just...

24
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:14,340
I'm afraid I'm not capable enough

25
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:16,780
to win Her Highness's heart.

26
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,020
I've disappointed you, Master.

27
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:21,780
Silly boy.

28
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:23,780
If you're having trouble,

29
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,540
come to me.

30
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:29,380
I called you here today to tell you

31
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:32,100
that as for the man the Princess favors,

32
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:34,420
I've taken care of him for you.

33
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:37,700
After Grand Princess Luling
has had her way with him,

34
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:39,340
Princess Danyang surely
won't want him anymore.

35
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:42,380
Now,

36
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,580
it's up to you

37
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:46,860
to win her over.

38
00:03:58,900 --> 00:03:59,420
Yan Shang.

39
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:00,700
I...

40
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:03,460
I've made a terrible mistake

41
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:04,420
and caused you great harm.

42
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:05,860
I beg your forgiveness.

43
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:10,740
What are you doing?

44
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:13,100
Bowing like that to someone lying in bed

45
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:14,260
is terribly unlucky.

46
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:15,460
Get up.

47
00:04:17,380 --> 00:04:18,060
Forgive me.

48
00:04:18,580 --> 00:04:19,420
I wasn't thinking straight.

49
00:04:20,460 --> 00:04:21,060
Take your time.

50
00:04:21,660 --> 00:04:22,420
What exactly happened?

51
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:27,060
The humiliation you've suffered

52
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:28,620
may have

53
00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:30,260
been my fault.

54
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:32,620
How so?

55
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:39,100
My master...

56
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:41,340
To help me,

57
00:04:41,940 --> 00:04:43,420
he told Grand Princess Luling

58
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:45,340
about your situation.

59
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,460
The Grand Princess

60
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,020
took an interest in you.

61
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:51,260
That's why you were taken away.

62
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:55,780
(Li Zhi.)

63
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:58,180
(I used to put up
with your endless nagging)

64
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:00,500
(and let it slide.)

65
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:02,580
(But you went and confessed on your own)

66
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:05,140
(that you forced my mother
into marriage.)

67
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:08,060
(And now you've dragged Yan Shang
into this.)

68
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:11,540
(It's time to settle all our scores,
old and new,)

69
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:14,020
(great and small.)

70
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:15,980
(My dear uncle.)

71
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:20,020
Fang Tong.

72
00:05:24,060 --> 00:05:24,940
What are your orders, Your Highness?

73
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:26,940
I want to meet Yu Cheng'an's adviser.

74
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:28,820
Wei Qiao, courtesy name Wei Zidu.

75
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:31,180
Arrange a meeting.

76
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:39,620
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

77
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:02,500
Chunhua!

78
00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:05,820
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
Chunhua! Chunhua!

79
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:06,700
Chunhua!

80
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:08,980
I...

81
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:14,500
Chunhua.

82
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:16,460
That day,

83
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:18,860
I was drunk.

84
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:21,540
I said many terrible things.

85
00:06:23,540 --> 00:06:24,540
I was too ashamed to face you.

86
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,220
But after spending days shut away
at home,

87
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:27,620
I couldn't stop regretting
what I'd done.

88
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:30,820
I had to come

89
00:06:31,980 --> 00:06:32,540
and apologize to you.

90
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:35,260
And to Yan Shang as well.

91
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:37,260
Whether you two can forgive me or not...

92
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:39,380
I don't know if Yan Shang
will forgive you.

93
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:43,300
Ask him yourself in a few days.

94
00:06:47,540 --> 00:06:48,900
I haven't seen him leave
his place lately.

95
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:51,540
He's injured.

96
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:53,220
He's recovering
at the Princess's residence.

97
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:55,140
He... What happened to him?

98
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:59,380
Ask him yourself once he's recovered.

99
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:01,180
I don't want to talk to you.

100
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:02,540
Chunhua!

101
00:07:03,820 --> 00:07:04,220
Chunhua!

102
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:09,460
Chunhua!

103
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:14,660
Watch where you're going!

104
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:15,820
Sorry.

105
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:16,900
My apologies.

106
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:34,620
(Yang Residence)

107
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:38,860
Chunhua.

108
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:42,220
What about you?

109
00:07:43,740 --> 00:07:44,620
Can you forgive me?

110
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:52,540
I'll have to think about that.

111
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:53,940
Okay.

112
00:07:54,340 --> 00:07:54,660
Sure.

113
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:55,660
Take your time.

114
00:07:56,140 --> 00:07:56,660
Think it over carefully.

115
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:57,780
I'll wait for you.

116
00:08:12,540 --> 00:08:13,380
Well, enough talking.

117
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,220
The Princess gave me the day off.

118
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:16,300
I'm heading home soon.

119
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:17,220
All right.

120
00:08:18,340 --> 00:08:19,780
Then take care on your way home.

121
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:24,900
Well...

122
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:26,860
I'll settle things with you
when I get back.

123
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:28,820
You still want to see me again?

124
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:32,060
You're still willing to settle things
with me?

125
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:40,780
(Yang Residence)

126
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:41,900
Just go home.

127
00:08:42,020 --> 00:08:42,780
Stop standing around.

128
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:45,100
All right.

129
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:47,420
I'll wait for you to come back.

130
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:50,220
Well...

131
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:51,420
I'll be going, then.

132
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:52,420
Okay, go ahead.

133
00:08:56,300 --> 00:09:00,220
(Yang Residence)

134
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:55,810
(Rising Sun, Waxing Moon)

135
00:10:21,540 --> 00:10:22,420
Greetings, Your Highness.

136
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:24,500
No need for formalities, Wei Qiao.

137
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:26,860
I'm deeply honored.

138
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:28,540
May I ask why Your Highness

139
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:29,740
has summoned me?

140
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:34,180
Everyone in Sheng'an knows
how talented you are, Mr. Wei.

141
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:36,260
What could I possibly teach you?

142
00:10:38,700 --> 00:10:39,380
Mr. Wei,

143
00:10:40,420 --> 00:10:41,380
I've made some inquiries.

144
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:42,940
You...

145
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:44,300
you're not wed yet, are you?

146
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:48,260
Your Highness,

147
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:49,300
what is it?

148
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:54,260
I've been terribly troubled
these past few days.

149
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:55,780
A few days ago,

150
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:57,700
Father wanted me to marry
the third-place scholar.

151
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,020
I refused.

152
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:01,220
Have you heard about that?

153
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:03,420
I have heard something of it.

154
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:06,540
Then you must also know

155
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:09,980
that my first marriage was far
from happy.

156
00:11:10,860 --> 00:11:12,020
Now that I'm seeking another husband,

157
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:13,140
I must choose carefully.

158
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,380
That third-place scholar
may have some talent,

159
00:11:16,700 --> 00:11:17,820
but he's just a peasant.

160
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:19,740
I certainly can't marry him.

161
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:22,700
There's an elder in my family

162
00:11:23,740 --> 00:11:25,620
who's taken a great interest
in my marriage.

163
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:27,900
He keeps insisting

164
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:30,020
that I marry someone
from the Wei family.

165
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:32,260
I've met his choice,

166
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:34,380
but I simply don't like the fellow.

167
00:11:35,060 --> 00:11:36,260
Born to a concubine in a lesser branch,

168
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:37,340
with neither parent alive...

169
00:11:37,580 --> 00:11:38,380
What future could he possibly have?

170
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:41,460
After giving it some thought,

171
00:11:42,500 --> 00:11:44,660
if I must marry someone
from your family,

172
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:47,100
the most sought-after
young man of the Wei family

173
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:49,140
in all of Sheng'an

174
00:11:49,980 --> 00:11:50,780
is none other than you.

175
00:11:52,340 --> 00:11:53,220
Besides,

176
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:55,860
you're much more to my taste.

177
00:11:58,020 --> 00:11:58,980
I'm unworthy of your affection,
Your Highness.

178
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:00,820
Unworthy?

179
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:01,380
Yes.

180
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:03,380
I'm not so fortunate.

181
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:05,660
I have no intention of marrying.

182
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:07,180
You dare reject me?

183
00:12:11,780 --> 00:12:12,660
It seems, Mr. Wei,

184
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:14,740
you're willing to let
such an extraordinary opportunity

185
00:12:14,900 --> 00:12:15,700
slip through your fingers.

186
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:17,220
I don't believe it.

187
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:19,900
Haven't you heard

188
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:21,420
the prophecy about me?

189
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:28,260
The daughter of Yaoguang Star

190
00:12:28,700 --> 00:12:29,700
shall bring glory to the royal house.

191
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:31,820
Whoever marries me...

192
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:32,300
Your Highness.

193
00:12:33,620 --> 00:12:34,220
What?

194
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:35,780
Perhaps you needn't marry me

195
00:12:35,780 --> 00:12:37,940
to solve your troubles.

196
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:39,580
May I ask

197
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:42,420
who's forcing you to marry
into the Wei family?

198
00:12:46,620 --> 00:12:47,340
I can't tell you.

199
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:48,940
After all,

200
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:50,780
he only wants what's best for me.

201
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:54,780
And which illegitimate son
of the Wei family

202
00:12:55,260 --> 00:12:56,140
has been chosen to marry you?

203
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:57,700
I can't tell you that either.

204
00:12:58,580 --> 00:12:59,380
After all,

205
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:01,380
he's your rival in love.

206
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:08,180
If Your Highness won't tell me,
so be it.

207
00:13:10,300 --> 00:13:10,700
I'll take my leave.

208
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:14,020
You really can't marry me?

209
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:23,580
Your Highness,

210
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,300
if my guess is correct,

211
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:26,340
your elder

212
00:13:26,340 --> 00:13:28,540
must have close ties to
that young man of the Wei family.

213
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:29,900
That's why he's forcing you
to marry him.

214
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:32,220
So even if you married me,

215
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:33,900
it wouldn't silence your elder.

216
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:34,740
He

217
00:13:35,260 --> 00:13:36,980
certainly wouldn't let it go.

218
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:39,820
You're both Weis, after all.

219
00:13:42,140 --> 00:13:43,820
I'm afraid I can't help you.

220
00:13:45,700 --> 00:13:46,140
One more thing.

221
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:47,820
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

222
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:51,460
but that prophecy concerning
Your Highness...

223
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:54,260
You shouldn't mention it so freely
in the future.

224
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:56,060
It's a prophecy of great fortune.

225
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:57,220
Why shouldn't I mention it?

226
00:14:01,420 --> 00:14:02,300
Don't worry.

227
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:04,540
I won't throw myself at you.

228
00:14:05,660 --> 00:14:07,580
There are plenty of young men
in the Wei family.

229
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:10,380
And plenty of men eager to marry me
for my destiny!

230
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:12,060
I'm sure I'll find

231
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:13,300
a husband who suits me!

232
00:14:17,220 --> 00:14:19,060
(Dong'e Ejiao)

233
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:24,580
(Chunhua's Home)

234
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:26,940
Mother! Brother! Sister-in-law!

235
00:14:26,940 --> 00:14:27,500
I'm home!

236
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,300
(Chunhua's Brother)
Mother, Chunhua's back!

237
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:31,380
(Chunhua's Sister-in-law)

238
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:34,060
(Chunhua's Mother)
Chunhua!

239
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:35,500
Mother.

240
00:14:35,940 --> 00:14:36,700
You're home.

241
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:44,060
You look like you've
put on a little weight.

242
00:14:46,700 --> 00:14:46,980
Mother,

243
00:14:47,260 --> 00:14:48,020
I brought back

244
00:14:48,020 --> 00:14:49,220
lots of lovely gifts from the Princess.

245
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:51,500
Oh...

246
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:52,940
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Keep this. It's good for your health.

247
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:54,340
(Dong'e Ejiao)

248
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:54,780
All right.

249
00:14:57,580 --> 00:14:57,820
Well...

250
00:14:58,780 --> 00:14:59,260
Sister-in-law,

251
00:15:00,380 --> 00:15:01,020
this is for you.

252
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:04,740
There's something for me too?

253
00:15:05,820 --> 00:15:06,940
You must've had a tiring journey.

254
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:07,420
Thank you.

255
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:10,060
Come, sit here.

256
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:12,700
Are you tired? Sit.

257
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:13,500
Not at all.

258
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:16,180
Chunhua,

259
00:15:16,580 --> 00:15:17,700
you may be a maid,

260
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:18,620
but I'd say

261
00:15:18,860 --> 00:15:21,140
you're better off than the daughters
of many wealthy families!

262
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:22,740
Look,

263
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:24,580
the Princess gave me this fabric.

264
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:26,460
You can use it to make yourself
some new clothes.

265
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:28,100
Mother.

266
00:15:28,500 --> 00:15:29,260
It's beautiful.

267
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:30,300
Brother.

268
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:31,660
What is it?

269
00:15:33,620 --> 00:15:34,660
These are the wages I've saved.

270
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:36,300
Use them for household expenses.

271
00:15:37,740 --> 00:15:38,020
Okay.

272
00:15:38,860 --> 00:15:39,300
You've grown up.

273
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:42,100
Chunhua,

274
00:15:42,380 --> 00:15:44,740
it seems you're really
in the Princess's good graces.

275
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:45,580
Chunhua,

276
00:15:46,660 --> 00:15:48,500
you've served the Princess for so long.

277
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:50,860
Could you put in a word with her

278
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:52,980
and ask her to find me a position?

279
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:54,900
(Dong'e Ejiao)

280
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:56,060
A position at the Princess's residence?

281
00:15:56,180 --> 00:15:57,620
I'm just a maid. I can't ask her
for something like that.

282
00:16:01,820 --> 00:16:02,580
That's true.

283
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:05,820
After all, the Princess is just a widow.

284
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:07,260
She's only a woman.

285
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:08,740
Whether she can arrange anything

286
00:16:09,620 --> 00:16:10,260
is another matter.

287
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:12,500
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Exactly.

288
00:16:21,860 --> 00:16:22,460
Chunhua,

289
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:25,060
how many days can you stay this time?

290
00:16:26,340 --> 00:16:26,660
Mother,

291
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:28,140
the Princess treats me so well.

292
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:29,500
She gave me three whole days off.

293
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:33,140
You call that treating you well?

294
00:16:34,060 --> 00:16:36,500
If she could find you a good husband,

295
00:16:37,060 --> 00:16:38,420
preferably an official,

296
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:41,220
someone who could bring honor
to our family,

297
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,180
now that would be treating you well!

298
00:16:44,660 --> 00:16:45,660
Mother's absolutely right.

299
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:46,580
Chunhua,

300
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,620
the Princess's residence is a place
of great wealth and privilege.

301
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:53,060
All sorts of powerful officials
and nobles visit.

302
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:57,020
Have you met anyone suitable
for marriage?

303
00:16:57,740 --> 00:16:58,180
If you have,

304
00:16:58,820 --> 00:16:59,700
you should ask the Princess about him!

305
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:00,540
(Dong'e Ejiao)
Exactly.

306
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:04,940
Preferably a high-ranking official.

307
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:09,820
The higher his rank, the better!

308
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:10,940
And if

309
00:17:11,340 --> 00:17:13,900
he could help your brother get ahead,
even better.

310
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:18,700
Anyone come to mind?

311
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:21,300
Think.

312
00:17:21,620 --> 00:17:22,060
Think about it.

313
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:22,700
Anyone?

314
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:25,860
Mother,

315
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:27,660
it's been so long since I was home.

316
00:17:28,180 --> 00:17:28,900
I'll go take a look out back.

317
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,700
What's there to see out back?

318
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,780
Aren't there lots of wildflowers
growing there?

319
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:37,940
I'll pick some.

320
00:17:39,820 --> 00:17:40,620
You're a grown woman.

321
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:41,860
Why are you still picking flowers?

322
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,420
Acting like a child.

323
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:46,420
I think Chunhua's gotten used
to living in luxury.

324
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:47,860
Now that she's home,

325
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:49,820
nothing here is good enough for her.

326
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:51,180
I...

327
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:53,260
Let me take a look!

328
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:54,100
She gave it to me!

329
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:55,340
You little...

330
00:17:55,580 --> 00:17:56,180
I'm hungry, Mother.

331
00:17:56,540 --> 00:17:56,860
Cook.

332
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:03,900
What a nuisance!

333
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,260
That woman.

334
00:18:08,140 --> 00:18:10,660
All she wants is to keep me cooped up
at home.

335
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:11,300
Your Highness,

336
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:13,300
(Mu Ti, Prince of Jin)
where shall we go hunting today?

337
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:15,460
Hunting? Who said anything
about hunting?

338
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:16,740
That's exhausting.

339
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:21,700
Let's just find ourselves
a nice hill today

340
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:23,060
and take a stroll.

341
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:24,940
We'll walk until nightfall

342
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:27,100
before heading home.

343
00:18:28,620 --> 00:18:30,420
So tiresome!

344
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:39,780
What's a young lady doing here?

345
00:18:47,620 --> 00:18:48,660
How can you be so careless?

346
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,180
Are you blind?

347
00:18:56,340 --> 00:18:56,900
You hit me!

348
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:57,980
Watch your mouth!

349
00:18:57,980 --> 00:18:59,180
You watch yours!

350
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:00,900
How rude!

351
00:19:02,460 --> 00:19:04,060
You're not hurt, are you, Miss?

352
00:19:06,300 --> 00:19:08,540
I'm afraid I haven't disciplined
my men properly.

353
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:10,260
They've caused you quite a fright.

354
00:19:10,820 --> 00:19:11,420
Allow me

355
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:13,620
to apologize.

356
00:19:18,980 --> 00:19:19,940
Greetings, Prince of Jin.

357
00:19:22,060 --> 00:19:23,620
You recognize me?

358
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:25,300
Of course.

359
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:27,900
I serve at Princess Danyang's residence.

360
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:32,780
So you're one of her servants.

361
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:34,780
What a coincidence.

362
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:36,500
May I ask why

363
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:39,180
you're out here in the wilderness
all alone?

364
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:40,020
Aren't you

365
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:42,500
afraid of running into wild beasts?

366
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:44,220
The Princess gave me the day off

367
00:19:44,700 --> 00:19:45,740
to visit my family.

368
00:19:46,660 --> 00:19:47,500
You're right, Your Highness.

369
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:48,740
I'll return to the residence at once.

370
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:50,180
Wait a moment, young lady.

371
00:19:56,540 --> 00:19:59,140
This hill is mostly covered
in wildflowers and grass.

372
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:01,220
If Your Highness wishes to hunt,

373
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:03,380
there's more game
on the hill to the west.

374
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:05,020
That's not what I wanted to ask.

375
00:20:05,660 --> 00:20:06,900
What I meant was...

376
00:20:09,060 --> 00:20:10,700
It's hot, and I'm rather thirsty.

377
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:13,180
I was hoping for a bowl of water.

378
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:15,220
You must live nearby, young lady.

379
00:20:15,580 --> 00:20:16,140
Would it

380
00:20:16,500 --> 00:20:17,660
be too much trouble?

381
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:21,740
Well...

382
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,140
Please follow me, Your Highness.

383
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:25,340
One moment.

384
00:20:33,660 --> 00:20:34,620
(Your Highness, allow us.)

385
00:20:34,620 --> 00:20:34,940
No.

386
00:20:35,580 --> 00:20:36,140
I'll do it myself.

387
00:20:45,620 --> 00:20:45,980
Lead the way.

388
00:21:07,740 --> 00:21:09,100
Mother! Brother! Sister-in-law!

389
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:10,060
We have an honored guest!

390
00:21:10,820 --> 00:21:12,140
You stay outside.

391
00:21:21,340 --> 00:21:22,860
Who's that man?

392
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:26,660
She went up the hill to pick flowers

393
00:21:26,740 --> 00:21:27,900
and came back with a man?

394
00:21:32,980 --> 00:21:33,620
Please, have some tea.

395
00:21:45,020 --> 00:21:46,860
Why is this tea so sweet?

396
00:21:55,380 --> 00:21:57,020
Mother, Brother, Sister-in-law.

397
00:21:57,820 --> 00:21:59,580
I just remembered an urgent task
the Princess gave me.

398
00:21:59,940 --> 00:22:00,860
I must return to her residence now.

399
00:22:04,210 --> 00:22:07,040
- Hey! Wait!
- Hey!

400
00:22:07,340 --> 00:22:07,860
Please, have some tea.

401
00:22:10,540 --> 00:22:11,940
Enjoy your tea.

402
00:22:18,220 --> 00:22:19,100
To tell you the truth,

403
00:22:19,900 --> 00:22:20,820
my younger sister

404
00:22:20,820 --> 00:22:22,700
now works at Princess Danyang's
residence.

405
00:22:22,940 --> 00:22:24,180
She's the Princess's

406
00:22:24,820 --> 00:22:25,940
most trusted attendant.

407
00:22:30,820 --> 00:22:33,460
Princess Danyang certainly knows
how to train her servants.

408
00:22:38,060 --> 00:22:39,620
Your humble family has certainly

409
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:41,460
produced a golden phoenix.

410
00:22:42,420 --> 00:22:43,140
Today,

411
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:44,820
I must say,

412
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:47,220
this trip was well worth my while.

413
00:22:51,540 --> 00:22:53,140
I failed to recognize Your Highness.

414
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:54,860
Please forgive me.

415
00:22:56,540 --> 00:22:57,740
Mother. Mother. He's a prince.

416
00:22:57,740 --> 00:22:58,260
Your Highness.

417
00:23:02,380 --> 00:23:04,580
How old is your daughter?

418
00:23:05,740 --> 00:23:06,580
Is she

419
00:23:07,940 --> 00:23:08,860
engaged to someone?

420
00:23:17,220 --> 00:23:17,740
Smells so lovely.

421
00:23:23,020 --> 00:23:23,460
Your Highness.

422
00:23:29,220 --> 00:23:30,340
Why are you home so late?

423
00:23:32,260 --> 00:23:34,060
I had nothing to do today,

424
00:23:34,540 --> 00:23:35,780
so I went outside the city
for some fresh air.

425
00:23:37,340 --> 00:23:38,620
So what did you catch today?

426
00:23:42,820 --> 00:23:44,780
Heaven cherishes all living creatures.

427
00:23:44,780 --> 00:23:47,060
I simply couldn't bear to kill anything.

428
00:23:47,780 --> 00:23:49,220
If you fancy some wild game,

429
00:23:49,700 --> 00:23:51,140
have the servants
buy some tomorrow.

430
00:23:52,020 --> 00:23:52,500
Sit down.

431
00:23:55,620 --> 00:23:57,260
You've been out all day, Your Highness.

432
00:23:57,780 --> 00:23:58,580
You must be tired.

433
00:24:00,220 --> 00:24:00,500
Come on.

434
00:24:01,420 --> 00:24:01,860
Let me

435
00:24:02,940 --> 00:24:03,780
give you a massage.

436
00:24:06,740 --> 00:24:08,220
No, no. I'm not tired.

437
00:24:08,700 --> 00:24:09,860
I... I was just

438
00:24:11,300 --> 00:24:12,300
heading to my study.

439
00:24:12,740 --> 00:24:12,980
Yes!

440
00:24:13,500 --> 00:24:14,020
My study!

441
00:24:14,860 --> 00:24:15,260
Your Highness!

442
00:24:15,740 --> 00:24:16,100
Your Highness!

443
00:24:22,380 --> 00:24:22,820
Bicao,

444
00:24:23,420 --> 00:24:24,220
do you think I'm getting old?

445
00:24:25,420 --> 00:24:27,020
Your Highness is a natural beauty.

446
00:24:27,260 --> 00:24:27,980
And you take such good care of yourself.

447
00:24:28,180 --> 00:24:29,180
How could you possibly look old?

448
00:24:32,060 --> 00:24:32,580
Indeed.

449
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:33,940
I'm not old yet,

450
00:24:34,780 --> 00:24:36,180
yet the Prince is already
casting me aside.

451
00:24:42,060 --> 00:24:45,740
(Pingkang Ward)

452
00:24:45,740 --> 00:24:46,300
Brother.

453
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:51,540
What's going on

454
00:24:52,100 --> 00:24:52,980
between you and Princess Danyang?

455
00:24:53,780 --> 00:24:54,260
Brother...

456
00:24:54,260 --> 00:24:55,020
Stay away from her.

457
00:24:55,860 --> 00:24:58,620
The Wei family must have nothing to do
with that prophecy.

458
00:25:01,220 --> 00:25:02,300
Princess Danyang and I

459
00:25:02,740 --> 00:25:03,500
have done nothing improper.

460
00:25:03,820 --> 00:25:04,540
There's nothing between us.

461
00:25:11,140 --> 00:25:11,820
Good.

462
00:25:16,140 --> 00:25:16,860
To think...

463
00:25:17,260 --> 00:25:18,740
We haven't seen each other in so long,

464
00:25:19,460 --> 00:25:20,380
yet when we finally meet,

465
00:25:20,740 --> 00:25:22,620
it's over something so absurd.

466
00:25:27,380 --> 00:25:27,820
Let me.

467
00:25:46,900 --> 00:25:47,540
You've grown up

468
00:25:48,220 --> 00:25:49,260
and certainly matured.

469
00:25:52,020 --> 00:25:53,340
Back at the family estate,

470
00:25:54,300 --> 00:25:55,380
you always looked out for me.

471
00:25:56,900 --> 00:25:57,460
This cup,

472
00:25:58,580 --> 00:25:59,260
I'd like to drink to you.

473
00:25:59,820 --> 00:26:00,060
No.

474
00:26:01,220 --> 00:26:01,900
This cup

475
00:26:02,620 --> 00:26:04,180
should celebrate your success
as the Top Scholar.

476
00:26:14,100 --> 00:26:16,980
There were so many children
in the Wei family back then.

477
00:26:17,620 --> 00:26:19,020
Though you lost your father
at a young age,

478
00:26:19,220 --> 00:26:20,700
you were the brightest of them all.

479
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:23,020
I remember, even as a little boy,

480
00:26:23,180 --> 00:26:24,860
you wrote better poetry than I did.

481
00:26:26,300 --> 00:26:29,660
Our family tutor praised your poetry
for its bold, spirited style.

482
00:26:30,620 --> 00:26:31,900
How old were you then?

483
00:26:33,620 --> 00:26:34,020
Six?

484
00:26:37,300 --> 00:26:38,220
The Wei family is large,

485
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:40,140
but you were the only one
who respected me.

486
00:26:43,340 --> 00:26:44,940
You were young back then,

487
00:26:45,140 --> 00:26:46,140
but you kept your thoughts to yourself.

488
00:26:46,900 --> 00:26:49,340
Our family had many branches,
and everyone had something to say.

489
00:26:49,460 --> 00:26:50,620
Most of them were snobs.

490
00:26:51,700 --> 00:26:52,380
Back then,

491
00:26:53,020 --> 00:26:54,660
did someone say something cruel

492
00:26:55,340 --> 00:26:56,500
that made you decide to leave?

493
00:26:59,940 --> 00:27:01,820
I lived at the family estate
until I was fourteen.

494
00:27:02,300 --> 00:27:03,180
They'd already been generous enough.

495
00:27:04,220 --> 00:27:05,580
I couldn't shamelessly
impose on them any longer.

496
00:27:11,900 --> 00:27:12,180
Cheers.

497
00:27:24,580 --> 00:27:25,620
Looking back,

498
00:27:26,020 --> 00:27:27,060
it seems life treated you

499
00:27:27,580 --> 00:27:28,180
rather better

500
00:27:28,660 --> 00:27:29,860
after you left the family.

501
00:27:33,740 --> 00:27:34,220
I...

502
00:27:35,180 --> 00:27:36,340
met my mentor.

503
00:27:37,620 --> 00:27:38,580
Li...

504
00:27:39,420 --> 00:27:39,860
Zhi.

505
00:27:41,820 --> 00:27:44,300
I recall he's the late Empress's
elder brother.

506
00:27:44,780 --> 00:27:46,140
He's always been an ambitious schemer,

507
00:27:46,140 --> 00:27:47,220
pretending to be a patron of the arts.

508
00:27:47,620 --> 00:27:48,500
He has many proteges.

509
00:27:51,500 --> 00:27:52,700
My mentor gave me food and lodging

510
00:27:53,300 --> 00:27:54,740
and let me study at his home.

511
00:27:55,300 --> 00:27:56,380
Now that you've topped the exams,

512
00:27:56,860 --> 00:27:58,260
you've brought honor
to his household too.

513
00:27:59,620 --> 00:28:00,380
But I heard

514
00:28:00,380 --> 00:28:01,860
that Li Zhi's own son

515
00:28:01,860 --> 00:28:03,140
has no talent for studying.

516
00:28:03,460 --> 00:28:04,300
So he sponsors

517
00:28:04,300 --> 00:28:06,380
over a hundred gifted scholars,

518
00:28:06,380 --> 00:28:07,380
hedging his bets.

519
00:28:07,900 --> 00:28:09,660
He makes them treat him as their father.

520
00:28:10,940 --> 00:28:11,740
Does he

521
00:28:12,380 --> 00:28:13,700
treat you the same way?

522
00:28:17,540 --> 00:28:19,540
My mentor gave me a second chance
at life.

523
00:28:20,260 --> 00:28:21,340
Of course I should...

524
00:28:21,340 --> 00:28:22,060
Should what?

525
00:28:23,340 --> 00:28:24,380
If he tells you to go east,

526
00:28:25,700 --> 00:28:26,780
you wouldn't dare go west.

527
00:28:35,060 --> 00:28:35,620
Shu,

528
00:28:36,980 --> 00:28:38,620
the hardest debts to repay

529
00:28:39,340 --> 00:28:40,500
are debts of gratitude.

530
00:28:42,060 --> 00:28:43,900
Know your own limits.

531
00:28:45,340 --> 00:28:46,820
Don't end up sacrificing

532
00:28:47,940 --> 00:28:48,780
your entire life to repay him.

533
00:28:59,660 --> 00:29:01,060
(That fool Li Zhi.)

534
00:29:01,780 --> 00:29:03,780
(Now that he's crossed that foolish
Mu Wanyao,)

535
00:29:05,260 --> 00:29:07,740
(who knows what trouble he'll stir up?)

536
00:29:08,580 --> 00:29:10,020
(He could drag the entire
Wei family into it.)

537
00:29:11,540 --> 00:29:13,060
(Yintaimen)

538
00:29:13,060 --> 00:29:15,380
(Yintaimen Investigation Office)

539
00:29:22,420 --> 00:29:23,060
- (Sir.)
- (Sir.)

540
00:29:24,620 --> 00:29:25,140
(Sir.)

541
00:29:26,420 --> 00:29:26,780
Mr. Wei.

542
00:29:32,140 --> 00:29:32,820
Sir.

543
00:29:36,740 --> 00:29:37,340
Li Zhi.

544
00:29:38,140 --> 00:29:39,900
The one from Princess Danyang's
maternal family.

545
00:29:40,580 --> 00:29:41,340
Go investigate him.

546
00:29:41,740 --> 00:29:42,020
Yes, sir.

547
00:29:42,500 --> 00:29:44,260
(Wang Qing, Chen Lian, Yintaimen Eunuchs)
We'll report back within two days.

548
00:29:44,620 --> 00:29:45,060
Half a day.

549
00:29:48,740 --> 00:29:49,060
Yes, sir.

550
00:29:52,260 --> 00:29:53,260
After half a day,

551
00:29:53,500 --> 00:29:55,940
whether you find anything or not,

552
00:29:56,500 --> 00:29:57,900
there's no need to report back.

553
00:29:58,900 --> 00:30:00,860
Give your findings directly
to the court censors

554
00:30:01,660 --> 00:30:02,380
and have him impeached.

555
00:30:09,660 --> 00:30:10,460
Qiongzhou sounds good.

556
00:30:11,260 --> 00:30:11,860
Send him there.

557
00:30:12,820 --> 00:30:13,140
Yes, sir.

558
00:30:18,340 --> 00:30:21,100
Qiongzhou is quite a place!

559
00:30:22,220 --> 00:30:24,580
A land full of poisonous miasma.

560
00:30:25,060 --> 00:30:28,420
Who could have angered you so, Mr. Wei?

561
00:30:28,420 --> 00:30:29,660
I'm not angry.

562
00:30:30,100 --> 00:30:31,540
I just find it utterly ridiculous.

563
00:30:32,460 --> 00:30:33,420
There's nothing I despise more

564
00:30:34,900 --> 00:30:36,260
than fools.

565
00:30:47,740 --> 00:30:48,460
Miss Chunhua.

566
00:30:55,140 --> 00:30:55,860
Was this your doing?

567
00:30:56,900 --> 00:30:57,780
You mean my uncle?

568
00:30:59,780 --> 00:31:00,740
Has the imperial decree arrived already?

569
00:31:02,660 --> 00:31:03,180
That was quick.

570
00:31:04,100 --> 00:31:05,140
Li Zhi, Vice Director
at the Ministry of Rites,

571
00:31:05,500 --> 00:31:06,740
has been demoted to Marshal
of Qiongzhou for bribery.

572
00:31:07,220 --> 00:31:08,020
He's ordered to leave
the capital immediately.

573
00:31:08,700 --> 00:31:09,220
So it was you.

574
00:31:10,460 --> 00:31:10,900
Then...

575
00:31:11,940 --> 00:31:13,180
What Wei Shu told me the other day...

576
00:31:13,900 --> 00:31:14,620
You heard everything?

577
00:31:14,860 --> 00:31:16,980
If I could rescue you
from Grand Princess Luling,

578
00:31:17,820 --> 00:31:18,740
I can certainly deal with

579
00:31:19,060 --> 00:31:21,180
the man responsible for putting you
through that ordeal.

580
00:31:22,180 --> 00:31:23,580
Now you've seen what I'm capable of.

581
00:31:24,500 --> 00:31:24,900
Well?

582
00:31:25,580 --> 00:31:26,580
Still dare to upset me like that?

583
00:31:30,420 --> 00:31:30,820
Your Highness,

584
00:31:32,620 --> 00:31:34,020
you didn't have to go this far for me.

585
00:31:34,460 --> 00:31:36,020
You may be willing
to swallow this insult,

586
00:31:36,580 --> 00:31:37,380
but I certainly won't.

587
00:31:38,740 --> 00:31:40,020
I had Li Zhi thrown out of Sheng'an,

588
00:31:40,780 --> 00:31:41,580
and not just because of you.

589
00:31:42,180 --> 00:31:43,260
I have my own reasons.

590
00:31:44,660 --> 00:31:46,580
Just accept what I've done for you.

591
00:31:47,140 --> 00:31:49,220
And spare me any more
of that irritating nonsense.

592
00:31:50,220 --> 00:31:51,140
How did you manage it?

593
00:31:53,420 --> 00:31:54,460
What else but the Yintaimen

594
00:31:54,980 --> 00:31:56,180
could have acted so quickly?

595
00:31:59,900 --> 00:32:01,100
You used Yu Cheng'an to do your work.

596
00:32:02,180 --> 00:32:02,540
Your Highness,

597
00:32:04,260 --> 00:32:05,660
you're making a deal with a tiger.

598
00:32:06,020 --> 00:32:06,980
And I got what I wanted.

599
00:32:08,380 --> 00:32:08,820
Didn't I?

600
00:32:23,980 --> 00:32:24,460
Thank you.

601
00:32:46,380 --> 00:32:47,140
(Then I'll take you there.)

602
00:32:47,380 --> 00:32:48,380
(Sweets for sale! Make way!)

603
00:32:50,900 --> 00:32:51,740
(Let's have a look over there.)

604
00:32:51,940 --> 00:32:52,260
Wenji.

605
00:32:54,540 --> 00:32:54,860
Shang.

606
00:32:56,100 --> 00:32:57,100
Don't stand in the draft.

607
00:32:57,780 --> 00:32:58,020
Come.

608
00:32:58,540 --> 00:32:59,060
Let's talk inside.

609
00:33:01,820 --> 00:33:02,220
Come on.

610
00:33:09,940 --> 00:33:10,340
Shang.

611
00:33:11,140 --> 00:33:11,660
I...

612
00:33:12,540 --> 00:33:14,500
I've been wondering when you'd come
to see me.

613
00:33:15,060 --> 00:33:15,540
I never thought

614
00:33:15,980 --> 00:33:17,700
I'd be waiting all these days.

615
00:33:20,780 --> 00:33:21,060
Shang,

616
00:33:21,940 --> 00:33:22,340
that day...

617
00:33:23,020 --> 00:33:23,820
Thank you for coming to see me.

618
00:33:25,300 --> 00:33:25,700
Wenji,

619
00:33:26,300 --> 00:33:26,860
do you remember

620
00:33:26,980 --> 00:33:28,460
when we studied together
at the local school?

621
00:33:29,900 --> 00:33:30,740
Whenever you helped me,

622
00:33:31,660 --> 00:33:32,300
and I tried to thank you,

623
00:33:32,980 --> 00:33:33,620
you'd always say,

624
00:33:34,180 --> 00:33:35,980
"There's no need for thanks
between friends."

625
00:33:37,100 --> 00:33:37,460
Now,

626
00:33:38,180 --> 00:33:39,260
it's my turn to say that to you.

627
00:33:43,820 --> 00:33:44,220
Shang.

628
00:33:45,500 --> 00:33:45,940
I'm sorry.

629
00:33:48,820 --> 00:33:49,980
And there's even less need to apologize.

630
00:33:51,220 --> 00:33:52,100
Now and always,

631
00:33:52,380 --> 00:33:53,340
no matter when or where,

632
00:33:54,020 --> 00:33:54,580
to me,

633
00:33:55,140 --> 00:33:56,660
you'll always be my dear schoolmate
and friend,

634
00:33:57,140 --> 00:33:57,660
Wenji.

635
00:34:07,380 --> 00:34:08,420
Chunhua said you were injured.

636
00:34:08,780 --> 00:34:09,060
What...

637
00:34:09,300 --> 00:34:09,860
What happened?

638
00:34:10,220 --> 00:34:11,020
Just some minor wounds.

639
00:34:11,620 --> 00:34:12,460
I'm almost fully recovered.

640
00:34:14,140 --> 00:34:15,220
You've seen Chunhua?

641
00:34:20,820 --> 00:34:21,700
The more I thought about it,

642
00:34:22,340 --> 00:34:23,420
the worse I felt about
what I did to her.

643
00:34:24,100 --> 00:34:24,580
And to you.

644
00:34:26,060 --> 00:34:26,860
But you were nowhere to be found.

645
00:34:27,340 --> 00:34:28,180
Then Chunhua came out

646
00:34:28,500 --> 00:34:29,820
and told me you were recovering
at the Princess's residence.

647
00:34:31,380 --> 00:34:32,020
So, have you two

648
00:34:32,580 --> 00:34:33,220
made up?

649
00:34:36,740 --> 00:34:37,300
She said

650
00:34:38,940 --> 00:34:39,700
she needed more time to think.

651
00:34:40,980 --> 00:34:42,060
Then there's still hope.

652
00:34:47,580 --> 00:34:47,860
Shang,

653
00:34:48,740 --> 00:34:50,940
I bought this lip rouge for Chunhua.

654
00:34:52,060 --> 00:34:53,940
You can come and go from
the Princess's residence freely.

655
00:34:54,500 --> 00:34:55,140
Could you

656
00:34:56,300 --> 00:34:56,940
give it to her for me?

657
00:34:59,580 --> 00:34:59,820
Of course.

658
00:35:03,460 --> 00:35:04,860
(Hurry up! Is all the food packed?)

659
00:35:04,860 --> 00:35:05,540
- (Get moving.)
- (Time to go.)

660
00:35:05,900 --> 00:35:06,260
(Don't worry.)

661
00:35:06,380 --> 00:35:07,500
(Thanks for looking after me
on the journey.)

662
00:35:07,500 --> 00:35:08,300
(Get some rest while you can.)

663
00:35:08,500 --> 00:35:09,060
(Thank you.)

664
00:35:09,940 --> 00:35:10,540
(Don't mention it.)

665
00:35:11,340 --> 00:35:11,860
(Have something to eat.)

666
00:35:11,860 --> 00:35:12,220
(Here.)

667
00:35:12,540 --> 00:35:12,940
(Get some rest.)

668
00:35:12,940 --> 00:35:13,580
(Sit down for a while.)

669
00:35:27,860 --> 00:35:28,460
How thoughtful of you

670
00:35:29,260 --> 00:35:30,500
to come see me off.

671
00:35:32,620 --> 00:35:34,100
At my age,

672
00:35:35,260 --> 00:35:36,860
I don't know if I'll survive

673
00:35:36,860 --> 00:35:38,980
the poisonous miasma
of that savage land.

674
00:35:41,540 --> 00:35:42,100
Wanyao,

675
00:35:42,900 --> 00:35:44,620
for all I've done

676
00:35:44,900 --> 00:35:46,260
for you and your mother,

677
00:35:46,580 --> 00:35:47,900
please find a way to help me.

678
00:35:48,820 --> 00:35:50,100
If there's any way to reverse this...

679
00:35:50,100 --> 00:35:50,500
Uncle,

680
00:35:51,220 --> 00:35:51,980
what are you talking about?

681
00:35:53,340 --> 00:35:54,580
This decree demoting you

682
00:35:55,460 --> 00:35:56,940
is my gift to you.

683
00:35:58,060 --> 00:35:58,380
What...

684
00:35:59,860 --> 00:36:00,700
What did you say?

685
00:36:04,180 --> 00:36:04,620
Uncle,

686
00:36:05,820 --> 00:36:06,540
in the past,

687
00:36:07,020 --> 00:36:08,340
you forced my mother into marriage.

688
00:36:09,340 --> 00:36:10,780
Now you're trying to sell me off too.

689
00:36:12,940 --> 00:36:13,340
Oh, and

690
00:36:14,220 --> 00:36:15,660
you nearly sold off my man as well.

691
00:36:16,740 --> 00:36:17,420
Wanyao.

692
00:36:18,900 --> 00:36:21,300
You're becoming more shameless
and unruly by the day!

693
00:36:22,220 --> 00:36:23,100
How can you say

694
00:36:23,220 --> 00:36:25,340
such indecent things?

695
00:36:26,060 --> 00:36:26,420
Uncle,

696
00:36:28,460 --> 00:36:29,260
all your life,

697
00:36:29,820 --> 00:36:31,500
you've made your fortune

698
00:36:32,140 --> 00:36:33,100
by selling others off.

699
00:36:33,700 --> 00:36:35,500
You've traded their blood and tears

700
00:36:35,940 --> 00:36:36,620
for the empty glory

701
00:36:36,860 --> 00:36:38,940
you and your Li family
so desperately crave.

702
00:36:40,020 --> 00:36:40,980
Glory or not,

703
00:36:41,660 --> 00:36:42,820
wealth or not,

704
00:36:43,660 --> 00:36:45,020
haven't you enjoyed them too?

705
00:36:45,780 --> 00:36:47,540
I made your mother the Empress.

706
00:36:47,820 --> 00:36:49,020
Wasn't that for her own good?

707
00:36:49,780 --> 00:36:52,180
I wanted you to marry
that young top scholar.

708
00:36:52,180 --> 00:36:54,260
Wasn't that for your own good?

709
00:36:56,460 --> 00:36:57,380
That's why

710
00:36:58,260 --> 00:36:59,420
I'm doing what's best for you now.

711
00:37:01,740 --> 00:37:02,180
Uncle,

712
00:37:03,100 --> 00:37:04,100
with your limited wits,

713
00:37:04,940 --> 00:37:06,340
you're simply not suited
to living in Sheng'an,

714
00:37:06,460 --> 00:37:07,980
where danger lurks at every turn.

715
00:37:09,460 --> 00:37:10,340
Stay too long,

716
00:37:10,780 --> 00:37:12,340
and you'll only come to a terrible end.

717
00:37:15,180 --> 00:37:16,020
You'd be much better off

718
00:37:17,780 --> 00:37:18,900
retiring peacefully in Qiongzhou.

719
00:37:43,500 --> 00:37:48,980
(Yes)

720
00:37:58,860 --> 00:37:59,180
Sir,

721
00:38:00,860 --> 00:38:03,140
there was a matter I didn't have time
to report to you

722
00:38:03,380 --> 00:38:04,380
before making a decision myself.

723
00:38:04,660 --> 00:38:05,700
It's about Li Zhi, isn't it?

724
00:38:07,500 --> 00:38:07,940
Yes.

725
00:38:10,180 --> 00:38:11,180
I heard...

726
00:38:12,700 --> 00:38:14,740
you sent him off to Qiongzhou.

727
00:38:15,820 --> 00:38:16,140
Yes.

728
00:38:17,380 --> 00:38:18,660
When dealing with clever opponents,

729
00:38:18,860 --> 00:38:20,100
you can always anticipate their moves.

730
00:38:20,620 --> 00:38:21,260
What's truly dangerous

731
00:38:21,580 --> 00:38:23,260
is a fool making reckless moves

732
00:38:23,740 --> 00:38:24,780
that defy all reason.

733
00:38:26,820 --> 00:38:28,660
Keeping someone like that in Sheng'an

734
00:38:28,860 --> 00:38:31,260
could invite all sorts
of unforeseen trouble.

735
00:38:31,780 --> 00:38:32,420
So...

736
00:38:33,060 --> 00:38:33,540
Zidu.

737
00:38:34,540 --> 00:38:35,580
No need to explain further.

738
00:38:36,100 --> 00:38:37,940
I have complete faith in your judgment.

739
00:38:39,100 --> 00:38:39,740
Thank you.

740
00:38:57,620 --> 00:38:59,660
So you don't even need
to announce yourself anymore?

741
00:39:00,500 --> 00:39:01,300
Fang Tong didn't stop me.

742
00:39:02,420 --> 00:39:03,340
Why were you out so early?

743
00:39:04,620 --> 00:39:05,380
I just went

744
00:39:05,380 --> 00:39:07,100
to see your enemy off
to Qiongzhou myself.

745
00:39:07,780 --> 00:39:09,460
Yan Shang, you owe me a feast for that.

746
00:39:09,860 --> 00:39:10,140
Of course.

747
00:39:10,700 --> 00:39:13,060
I owe you far more than one feast,
Your Highness.

748
00:39:13,860 --> 00:39:14,620
Glad you know that.

749
00:39:23,900 --> 00:39:24,980
On my way back,

750
00:39:25,740 --> 00:39:28,140
I saw some Shence soldiers
eating a slaughtered farm ox.

751
00:39:28,740 --> 00:39:29,820
They were a disgusting sight.

752
00:39:30,900 --> 00:39:32,980
Yu Cheng'an is seizing land
outside the city for a hunting ground.

753
00:39:33,460 --> 00:39:35,140
It's stirred up a lot of public
anger lately.

754
00:39:35,660 --> 00:39:36,500
Have you heard about it?

755
00:39:36,780 --> 00:39:38,580
He hardly strikes me as someone
who enjoys hunting.

756
00:39:39,740 --> 00:39:40,580
Why go to such lengths

757
00:39:40,580 --> 00:39:42,340
to build a hunting ground?

758
00:39:43,180 --> 00:39:43,780
For money?

759
00:39:44,580 --> 00:39:45,020
For land?

760
00:39:45,740 --> 00:39:46,380
To raise warhorses.

761
00:39:46,700 --> 00:39:47,380
To stockpile weapons.

762
00:39:47,620 --> 00:39:48,140
Any of those are possible.

763
00:39:49,260 --> 00:39:49,740
But

764
00:39:50,220 --> 00:39:51,180
if that's the case,

765
00:39:52,020 --> 00:39:53,740
he may be digging his own grave.

766
00:39:55,340 --> 00:39:57,420
If he has some scheme involving
the hunting ground,

767
00:39:57,900 --> 00:39:59,380
he'll likely go there himself,

768
00:40:00,300 --> 00:40:02,740
leaving his heavily guarded residence
and Yintaimen.

769
00:40:03,140 --> 00:40:04,420
If he's planning something...

770
00:40:04,980 --> 00:40:06,260
The moment he reveals
his true intentions

771
00:40:07,020 --> 00:40:08,660
will be our chance
to catch him off guard.

772
00:40:15,020 --> 00:40:15,860
So,

773
00:40:16,500 --> 00:40:17,580
what did you actually come here for?

774
00:40:19,420 --> 00:40:20,260
I brought something.

775
00:40:27,380 --> 00:40:28,820
This lip rouge...

776
00:40:29,500 --> 00:40:30,660
Don't tell me it's for me?

777
00:40:35,740 --> 00:40:36,540
It's...

778
00:40:37,460 --> 00:40:39,020
a gift from Liu Wenji to Chunhua.

779
00:40:39,900 --> 00:40:40,540
He asked me to deliver it.

780
00:40:43,420 --> 00:40:44,700
She was just here a moment ago.

781
00:40:45,140 --> 00:40:46,100
Where did she go?

782
00:40:48,020 --> 00:40:48,620
I'll give it to her.

783
00:40:54,900 --> 00:40:55,260
Your Highness,

784
00:40:56,340 --> 00:40:57,420
Chunhua just received word

785
00:40:57,620 --> 00:40:58,900
that her mother had suddenly
fallen seriously ill.

786
00:40:59,300 --> 00:41:00,180
She rushed home immediately

787
00:41:00,540 --> 00:41:01,540
and asked me to request leave
on her behalf.

788
00:41:06,060 --> 00:41:06,420
Mother!

789
00:41:07,660 --> 00:41:08,100
Mother!

790
00:41:10,620 --> 00:41:11,340
Chunhua!

791
00:41:11,700 --> 00:41:12,100
Chunhua!

792
00:41:12,300 --> 00:41:13,060
- Mother.
- You're back!

793
00:41:15,660 --> 00:41:16,620
Mother, I heard you were ill!

794
00:41:18,460 --> 00:41:19,900
Mother just caught a chill.

795
00:41:20,060 --> 00:41:20,700
She took some herbal medicine

796
00:41:20,700 --> 00:41:21,940
and rested for two days. She's fine now.

797
00:41:23,180 --> 00:41:23,820
I'm much better.

798
00:41:25,740 --> 00:41:26,020
Come on.

799
00:41:26,900 --> 00:41:27,820
Take her luggage inside.

800
00:41:30,540 --> 00:41:31,220
You're really all right?

801
00:41:33,180 --> 00:41:33,580
Come, sit down.

802
00:41:38,060 --> 00:41:38,740
Chunhua,

803
00:41:40,300 --> 00:41:41,820
look at you. You're so beautiful.

804
00:41:46,020 --> 00:41:47,060
So beautiful.

805
00:41:47,300 --> 00:41:47,620
Mother,

806
00:41:48,620 --> 00:41:49,500
are you sure you're all right?

807
00:41:50,500 --> 00:41:52,140
I brought some more herbs this time.

808
00:41:52,460 --> 00:41:53,180
You should try them.

809
00:41:55,020 --> 00:41:56,140
I just missed you, dear.

810
00:41:58,820 --> 00:41:59,820
All I've ever wanted

811
00:42:01,420 --> 00:42:02,260
in this life

812
00:42:02,420 --> 00:42:04,180
is to find you a good husband.

813
00:42:05,140 --> 00:42:06,700
And now, heaven has answered my prayers

814
00:42:07,540 --> 00:42:08,820
and granted my wish.

815
00:42:10,820 --> 00:42:11,980
Mother, what are you talking about?

816
00:42:12,220 --> 00:42:12,500
I...

817
00:42:15,540 --> 00:42:17,180
Chunhua, look at your life now.

818
00:42:17,740 --> 00:42:19,740
You may have food and clothing,

819
00:42:20,020 --> 00:42:22,340
but you're still just a servant.

820
00:42:22,980 --> 00:42:23,460
In this world,

821
00:42:23,900 --> 00:42:25,740
no master treats a servant as an equal.

822
00:42:25,740 --> 00:42:26,140
Mother.

823
00:42:26,940 --> 00:42:28,180
The Princess genuinely cares about me.

824
00:42:29,220 --> 00:42:30,540
But you're still a servant.

825
00:42:32,500 --> 00:42:33,180
Just imagine.

826
00:42:34,020 --> 00:42:36,300
If you could marry
into a prince's household,

827
00:42:37,780 --> 00:42:39,460
even as a secondary consort...

828
00:42:39,740 --> 00:42:40,140
- You...
- Wait.

829
00:42:40,540 --> 00:42:41,740
Who said I wanted to marry a prince?

830
00:42:44,260 --> 00:42:45,060
Mother, what's going on?

831
00:42:45,140 --> 00:42:45,580
Nothing.

832
00:42:46,420 --> 00:42:49,060
Mother was just asking.

833
00:42:49,780 --> 00:42:52,020
Look how worked up Chunhua is.

834
00:42:53,580 --> 00:42:53,940
Chunhua,

835
00:42:54,700 --> 00:42:55,460
tell me,

836
00:42:56,620 --> 00:42:57,180
would you

837
00:42:57,660 --> 00:42:59,980
like to become a consort
in a prince's household?

838
00:43:11,180 --> 00:43:11,980
Forget marrying a prince.

839
00:43:12,420 --> 00:43:13,580
I wouldn't marry even the Emperor!

840
00:43:14,300 --> 00:43:15,460
I'm perfectly happy
serving the Princess.

841
00:43:15,460 --> 00:43:16,220
Why should I get married?

842
00:43:17,860 --> 00:43:19,380
And if I do, it'll be to someone I love.

843
00:43:20,900 --> 00:43:21,860
Silly girl!

844
00:43:22,100 --> 00:43:23,820
What good is love?

845
00:43:23,980 --> 00:43:24,340
Love...

846
00:43:24,700 --> 00:43:26,540
Mother, let me make this clear.

847
00:43:26,780 --> 00:43:27,980
I serve the Princess now.

848
00:43:28,420 --> 00:43:29,100
Whether I marry or not

849
00:43:29,180 --> 00:43:30,300
isn't up to any of you.

850
00:43:30,740 --> 00:43:31,980
It's not even up to me!

851
00:43:34,580 --> 00:43:35,500
I'm not marrying anyone.

852
00:43:36,020 --> 00:43:36,900
I only want to stay
by Her Highness's side.

853
00:43:37,220 --> 00:43:39,620
Fine. Whatever you say.

854
00:43:40,140 --> 00:43:40,900
You're all grown up now.

855
00:43:40,900 --> 00:43:42,260
We can't tell you what to do anymore.

856
00:43:46,900 --> 00:43:48,060
Chunhua's traveled such a long way.

857
00:43:48,180 --> 00:43:48,940
She must be hungry.

858
00:43:50,540 --> 00:43:51,020
Well...

859
00:43:51,700 --> 00:43:52,740
Let's get you something to eat.

860
00:43:53,020 --> 00:43:53,780
Exactly. Chunhua,

861
00:43:54,700 --> 00:43:56,140
you were in such a hurry

862
00:43:56,140 --> 00:43:57,620
and spent half the day traveling here.

863
00:43:58,420 --> 00:43:59,340
You worry about me,

864
00:43:59,460 --> 00:44:00,580
and I worry about you too.

865
00:44:01,420 --> 00:44:02,580
We made you some sweet soup.

866
00:44:03,300 --> 00:44:03,940
Go on, drink it.

867
00:44:05,260 --> 00:44:07,220
It'll calm you down
and soothe your throat.

868
00:44:07,220 --> 00:44:07,780
Thank you.

869
00:44:19,860 --> 00:44:24,620
(Next Episode Preview)

870
00:44:26,940 --> 00:44:27,860
By Lord Yu's order,

871
00:44:28,020 --> 00:44:30,260
the murder suspect must not
be taken to the Capital Prefecture!

872
00:44:30,380 --> 00:44:32,340
The Yintaimen Investigation Office
will handle the case.

873
00:44:38,020 --> 00:44:39,860
I want to see Lord Yu...

874
00:44:41,800 --> 00:44:45,093
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

875
00:44:47,778 --> 00:44:52,694
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

876
00:44:54,888 --> 00:45:00,733
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

877
00:45:01,233 --> 00:45:06,459
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

878
00:45:09,228 --> 00:45:14,019
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

879
00:45:14,855 --> 00:45:20,934
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

880
00:45:22,735 --> 00:45:25,885
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

881
00:45:25,885 --> 00:45:27,533
♪Burning bright as a song♪

882
00:45:27,585 --> 00:45:31,309
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

883
00:45:31,687 --> 00:45:36,353
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

884
00:45:36,972 --> 00:45:41,013
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

885
00:45:41,504 --> 00:45:43,619
♪Not a single hour less♪

886
00:45:43,659 --> 00:45:50,605
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

887
00:45:51,368 --> 00:45:54,821
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

888
00:45:55,001 --> 00:45:58,146
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

889
00:45:58,585 --> 00:46:05,222
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

890
00:46:05,619 --> 00:46:07,657
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

891
00:46:07,657 --> 00:46:10,133
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

892
00:46:10,171 --> 00:46:12,640
♪You're the only one I need♪

893
00:46:12,844 --> 00:46:19,731
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

894
00:46:20,043 --> 00:46:23,314
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

895
00:46:23,619 --> 00:46:26,792
♪My last untouched innocence♪

896
00:46:27,116 --> 00:46:30,542
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

897
00:46:30,775 --> 00:46:34,000
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

898
00:46:34,331 --> 00:46:41,127
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

899
00:46:41,496 --> 00:46:43,558
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

900
00:46:43,559 --> 00:46:46,062
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

901
00:46:46,109 --> 00:46:48,447
♪You're the only one I need♪

902
00:46:48,678 --> 00:46:55,513
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

903
00:46:55,862 --> 00:46:57,480
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

904
00:46:57,610 --> 00:46:59,406
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

905
00:46:59,763 --> 00:47:02,780
♪You're the only one I need♪

906
00:47:02,820 --> 00:47:04,147
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
